# 2. GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq — uuid < 14.0.0 (Buffer bounds check)
#    Via: @sentry/webpack-plugin, exceljs, @arcjet/next (via typeid-js)
#    Risk: LOW for our app — the vulnerable code path (v3/v5/v6 + buf arg)
#          is not invoked in our codebase. We don't pass custom buffers to uuid.
#    Fix: Waiting for exceljs, @sentry, and @arcjet to upgrade uuid internally.
#    Ref: https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq
